{{!-- The kebab menu of one queue entry: open, and whichever of send now / retry / remove apply
      to its state. Rendered inside an ee-stack-actions cell of a listing row, and nowhere else;
      the detail page lays the same actions out as toolbar buttons. Context: a formatted entry
      (url, canPromote, canRetry, canRemove, title).

      Remove goes through the shared .list-delete-btn flow of ui/row-actions, which fills the
      page's #removeJob dialog (queue_job_actions) with the entry's name and action. The Open
      item is rendered here rather than through the partial's openHref on purpose: a partial
      block whose content is nothing but {{#if}} wrappers loses it to the Handlebars
      program-association bug (see .claude/rules/admin-ui.md), so the block's first token has
      to be a static element. --}}
{{#> ui/row-actions label="Entry actions" deleteModal=(when canRemove "#removeJob" "") deleteName=title deleteAction=(concat url "/remove") deleteLabel="Remove"}}
<li><a class="dropdown-item" href="{{url}}">Open</a></li>
{{#if canPromote}}
<li><button type="button" class="dropdown-item queue-action-btn" data-action="{{url}}/promote">Send now</button></li>
{{/if}}
{{#if canRetry}}
<li><button type="button" class="dropdown-item queue-action-btn" data-action="{{url}}/retry">Retry</button></li>
{{/if}}
{{/ui/row-actions}}
